# Overlay on top of archiso releng. ISO kernel stays the live image;
# the installed system gets linux-zen from packages.conf (not stock linux).
# Package names must be the whole line. mkarchiso keeps trailing spaces
# as part of the pacman target (v0.1.2 failed as "calamares                       ").
hyprland
quickshell
